<p style="border-width: 0.0px; padding: 10.0px 20.0px; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0.0px; outline-style: none; outline-width: 0.0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 10.0pt; text-align: left;">Contact us by telephone at <span class="baec5a81-e4d6-4674-97f3-e9220f0136c1" style="white-space: nowrap;">416-863-5639<a href="#" style="border-bottom: medium none; position: static; border-left: medium none; margin: 0.0px; width: 16.0px; bottom: 0.0px; display: inline; white-space: nowrap; float: none; height: 16.0px; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; border-top: medium none; top: 0.0px; right: 0.0px; border-right: medium none; left: 0.0px;" title="Call: 416-863-5639"></a></span>.</p>
